[00:48.12]“Listen to my prayer,” Jehovah.
[00:56.94]Let yourself be found by me.
[01:06.96]Feel the anguish deep inside me;
[01:13.55]Help me unafraid to be.
[01:22.11](Chorus)
[01:22.26]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[01:27.88]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[01:36.04]He will always give protection.
[01:42.66]He is loyal; he is true.
[01:51.58]Had I wings just as a dove has,
[01:57.40]Far from danger I would fly,
[02:03.56]Safe from those who seek to hurt me,
[02:09.44]Sheltered from their hateful cry.
[02:19.83](Chorus)
[02:19.98]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[02:25.30]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[02:33.78]He will always give protection.
[02:39.76]He is loyal; he is true.
[02:56.88]Comfort from our God, Jehovah,
[03:02.86]Always brings us peace of mind.
[03:10.14]He will help us bear our burden.
[03:17.97]He is loving; he is kind.
[03:26.45](Chorus)
[03:26.60]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[03:31.80]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[03:39.71]He will always give protection.
[03:45.66]He is loyal; he is true.
